# Who may build the Linux release packages: SSH public keys in ssh-keygen's allowed_signers format, one per line.
# `release.sh build-linux` signs release/linux/linux-build.json with one of these keys, and `release.sh publish`
# refuses Linux packages whose stamp is not signed by a key listed here. Change this file only in a reviewed PR.
#
#   <github-login> namespaces="riggverk-linux-build" <key-type> <public-key>
